  "description": "A world where pigs exist as a subspecies of humans.\n\nOne day, Gu-Dam comes face to face with his mother, who has turned into a pig, and continues his daily life alongside her. What is a pig, and how is it defined? Where does it begin and where does it end? How are humans defined? Gu-Dam struggles endlessly with these questions as he fights to carry on his life with her mother.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
